# MASTER PROMPT — COMPLETE AI GERMAN READING, LISTENING & TEXT GENERATION APPLICATION

## PROJECT NAME
Deutsch Meister – AI German Reading, Listening & Learning Studio

## 1. PROJECT OVERVIEW

Build a complete, professional, fully functional AI-powered German learning application.

The application must combine:

1. AI German Text Generator.
2. German reading and listening system.
3. Natural German female Text-to-Speech.
4. Sentence-by-sentence synchronized reading.
5. Individual word pronunciation on click.
6. Arabic translation and vocabulary explanations.
7. Complete CEFR learning levels from A1 to C2.
8. Long listening sessions and concentration mode.
9. Personal vocabulary and learning history.
10. Importing and reading external German documents.

This must be a real working application, not a static mockup or UI demonstration.

The application must be designed for people learning German from beginner level A1 up to advanced level C2.

The user must be able to generate original German texts, listen to them with a natural German female voice, follow the sentences visually, click individual words to hear their pronunciation, and understand vocabulary through Arabic explanations.

IMPORTANT:
Do not simplify the project into a basic Text-to-Speech converter.
Build a complete German language reading and listening learning platform.

