Default: OFF.

The user can choose whether normal reading resumes automatically after the selected word is pronounced.

## 29. WORD PRONUNCIATION QUALITY

Use the same selected German voice.

Ensure correct pronunciation for:
- Nouns.
- Verbs.
- Adjectives.
- Compound words.
- Separable verbs.
- Prefixes.
